# MASTER WEBSITE DEVELOPMENT PROMPT — CHOICE LAUNDRY SERVICES

## PROJECT OVERVIEW

Act as an expert full-stack web developer, UI/UX designer, database architect, and software engineer.

Build a complete, modern, premium, responsive, and production-ready laundry service website and customer management system for a laundry business named **CHOICE LAUNDRY SERVICES**.

The website must combine a beautiful public-facing business website with a fully functional online booking system, secure customer accounts, WhatsApp communication, order tracking, pickup coordination, customer notifications, and an administrative dashboard for managing the entire laundry business.

The final application must be suitable for real customers, work on mobile phones and desktop computers, and be deployable on Vercel.

Do not create only a landing page, visual mockup, or static demonstration. Implement the frontend, backend, database integration, authentication, booking functionality, customer dashboard, administrator dashboard, and necessary security controls.

If any external service requires credentials, provide the correct configuration instructions and a clear fallback until the credentials are supplied.

Do not invent real business contact details, prices, customer reviews, or business credentials.

