11. AUTOMATIC PERSONALIZED WHATSAPP BOOKING
==================================================

WhatsApp integration is a core requirement.

Create a reusable WhatsApp helper that builds personalized messages from the customer's account and booking details.

Configure the business WhatsApp number centrally so the owner can change it without editing multiple components.

Example Nigerian international number format:

234XXXXXXXXXX

Replace this placeholder with the real business WhatsApp number before deployment.

Use the standard WhatsApp click-to-chat URL format:

https://wa.me/BUSINESS_NUMBER?text=ENCODED_MESSAGE

Construct the URL correctly using URL encoding.

Do not include spaces, plus signs, brackets, or punctuation in the international phone number.

When a customer books an ironing service, generate a message similar to this:

"Hello Choice Laundry Services!

I would like to book your ironing service.

CUSTOMER DETAILS
Name: [Customer Name]
Phone: [Customer Phone]
Order Reference: [Order Reference]

SERVICE DETAILS
Service: Ironing
Garment Type: [Garment Type]
Number of Items: [Quantity]
Special Instructions: [Instructions]

PICKUP DETAILS
Preferred Date: [Pickup Date]
Preferred Time: [Pickup Time]
Pickup Address: [Pickup Address]

Please confirm the price and pickup arrangements.

Thank you."

DYNAMIC MESSAGE RULES

For complete laundry, include the chosen package, approximate quantity, and finishing preferences.

For washing only, include the garment type and quantity or weight.

For washing and ironing, include both the washing and finishing requirements.

For bedding, include the types and quantities of bedding.

For bulk laundry, include the estimated quantity and additional requirements.

For all other services, include only the relevant service-specific information.

Include the customer name and order reference in every booking message.

If optional information is missing, omit that line instead of displaying "undefined" or broken values.

WHATSAPP BEHAVIOUR

- Open WhatsApp on mobile when available.
- Support WhatsApp Web on desktop.
- Prefill the message.
- Let the customer review and send the message.
- Do not pretend the message has been sent automatically.
- Do not assume that opening WhatsApp means the business received the booking.
- Save the booking to the database before opening the WhatsApp link.
- Provide a fallback confirmation screen if the WhatsApp application cannot open.
- Provide a separate WhatsApp contact button on order detail pages.

If the business WhatsApp number is missing, display a clear setup message and allow the customer to retain their saved booking.

